OL,3,AOpenAI agents get rebrand - as 'dots' -
OL,4,Awhile safety worries delay new model
OL,5,
OL,6,FDots, however, were pitched as brightly
OL,7,Fcoloured cute cartoons meant to
OL,8,Ffunction as digital assistants for
OL,9,Fpeople with busy lives.
